@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api

### Get all tags
GET {{baseUrl}}/tags

### Get tags stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/tags/stats

### Get all tags raw
GET {{baseUrl}}/tags/raw

### Get tag by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/tags/1

### Add new tag
POST {{baseUrl}}/tags
Content-Type: application/json

